post-it: Computer doesn't start - just a bunch of text
cause: Floppy left in drive A:
symptoms:
	Stops before Windows starts
	Error text at startup
checks:
	no: Windows starts
	yes: Memory test passes
	yes: Shows a picture at power-on
	yes: Stops at "Non-System disk or disk error"
	yes: Floppy in drive A:
		shows: sticks out of the drive; the eject button pulses
	no: Fans run but no picture
software steps:
	Eject the floppy
	Restart
notes:
	Error message when booting "Non-System disk or disk error
	Replace and press any key when ready"
	In the game, the drive's eject button sticks out and pulses while a diskette is in A:; a click ejects it (Mascolls, #204).
